WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.120
Perseverance, and a helicopter.

00:02.891 --> 00:08.108
Perseverance landed in this crater in 2021, where a river once ran into a lake.

00:08.649 --> 00:12.139
It is filling tubes with rock for a later mission to bring home.

00:12.738 --> 00:20.144
It carried a small helicopter, Ingenuity, which made seventy-two flights: the first powered flights on another world.
